 looks like one frame\n(it works better when attaching a camera to the character)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[charabodybug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18339999/charabodybug.zip)\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101253/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101253/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}